## 벤치마크 적용

- 소스 1: [Jasper Knowledge Base](https://help.jasper.ai/hc/en-us/articles/18618707176347-Knowledge-Base), [Jasper Brand Voice](https://help.jasper.ai/hc/en-us/articles/18618693085339-Brand-Voice) — knowledge asset와 voice의 생성·편집·적용 구조를 확인. OSMU는 여기에 human-confirmed active version과 artifact-used immutable lineage를 추가해야 한다.
- 소스 2: [HubSpot Campaigns](https://knowledge.hubspot.com/campaigns/create-campaigns?is_listing=false), [HubSpot Marketing Studio](https://knowledge.hubspot.com/campaigns/create-campaigns-using-marketing-studio) — goal, audience, budget, owner, assets, calendar/board/list를 campaign unit에 결합하는 구조를 확인. OSMU는 paid execution을 복제하지 않고 승인·proof·next experiment 계보만 취한다.
- 소스 3: [GitHub Contents API](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/contents) — repo/path/ref, Contents read permission, directory/file limits를 확인. OSMU import provenance와 failure boundary의 근거로 사용한다.

